1
00:00:00,294 --> 00:00:03,224
(Sheldon:)I was too busy
trying not to defecate.

2
00:00:05,198 --> 00:00:07,528
(Leonard:)You know, when they were
escorting us

3
00:00:07,534 --> 00:00:10,734
(Leonard:)to the detaining room,
I looked through a door,

4
00:00:10,737 --> 00:00:12,737
(Leonard:)and I'm pretty sure
I saw a display case

5
00:00:12,739 --> 00:00:14,709
(Leonard:)with the Ark
of the Covenant.

6
00:00:14,708 --> 00:00:17,038
(Sheldon:)That's amazing.
(chuckling):
I know.

7
00:00:17,044 --> 00:00:20,344
(Sheldon:)And I saw Jabba the Hutt
riding by on a motorcycle.

8
00:00:20,347 --> 00:00:22,747
(Sheldon:)Although that was
right after the Tasing,

9
00:00:22,749 --> 00:00:24,619
(Sheldon:)so who can
say for sure?

10
00:00:26,252 --> 00:00:28,992
I-I guess this could count
as an adventure.

11
00:00:28,989 --> 00:00:30,319
(Howard:)It was.

12
00:00:30,324 --> 00:00:32,994
(Sheldon:)And even though we're
not allowed back there,

13
00:00:32,993 --> 00:00:35,093
(Sheldon:)they can never take
today away from us.

14
00:00:35,995 --> 00:00:37,995
(Sheldon:)Unlike my sense
of smell,

15
00:00:37,998 --> 00:00:40,398
(Sheldon:)which hasn't returned
since the Tasing.

16
00:00:41,534 --> 00:00:43,164
(sniffs)

17
00:00:43,170 --> 00:00:44,570
(Sheldon:)No, I got nothing.

18
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:54,450
(panting): Amy, the Daleks
are right on my tail!

19
00:00:54,448 --> 00:00:56,778
(Sheldon:)Quick, we need to reset
the time circuits.

20
00:00:56,783 --> 00:00:59,853
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, I left my sonic
screwdriver behind.

21
00:01:02,355 --> 00:01:06,425
(Amy:)Really should have
thought this through.

